ee the LS to RAN2 in Annex 1.{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Proposal 3: Agree the change to TS38.300 in Annex 2. It is proposed for RAN3 to decide whether it is a Rel-17 CR {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 or a TP for Rel-18.{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Ericsson: it is not just because it is feasible, we need to do it; we have a solution which works since REL-16 (C-RNTI{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1  plus timer){\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 ZTE: from RAN2 point of view both solutions work{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Lenovo: prefers to use legacy solution{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Qualcomm: both solutions work, LS to RAN2 needed, even if we have both solutions it could help in other cases so {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 we need to explain this to RAN2{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 CATT: prefers legacy solution, can discuss "configuration information" based approach in next REL{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Huawei: also prefers legacy solution{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Nokia: in favour of configuration information solution but open for discussion{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 RAN3 Chair: so we need to inform RAN2, we can decide whether in REL-18 we have 2 or just 1 solution{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Ericsson: we have a number of concerns about configuration infiormation: size of the information, breaking RRC {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 principles etc. so we need to clarify this as well, doubts that RAN2 will be able to solve these aspects in one meeting{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 RAN3 chair: would it be acceptable that we go for the simple solution in REL-18 and not consider "configuration {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 information" solution in REL-18?{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Qualcomm: we need to clarify what the problems are, RAN2 knows the RAN2 problems already; we can indicate {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 what are the differences and let them decide{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Huawei: RAN3 needs to decide which solution is preferred from RAN3{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 RAN3 chair: suggests RAN3 LS to RAN2 and RAN3 to decide on solution for REL-18{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Ericsson: discussing the "configuration information" solution for other features in REL-18 would make things even {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 more difficult for RAN2 as they would have to discuss it under multiple features{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\sb40\tqr\tx10649{\plain\tab\fs20\ul\f5\cf0\cb1 The document was not pursued.{\fs25\par}}\pard\plain\sb39\tqr\tx10652{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Replaced by {\fs25\par}}{\page}\pard\plain\tx90\tx1868\tqr\tx10648{\plain\fs20\b\f3\cf2\cb1 R3-235210\plain\tab\fs20\b\f7\cf0\cb1 (TP for SON BLCR for 37.340 and 38.423) SON enhancement for SPR\plain\tab\fs20\i\b\f6\cf0\cb1 Samsung{\fs25\par}}\pard\plain\tx90{\plain\fs16\f4\cf0\cb1 Replaces {\fs21\par}}\pard\plain\sb115\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Proposal 1: The SN can propose its preferred T310/T312 SPR thresholds to MN.{\fs25\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 Proposal 2: If SN preferred T310/T312 SPR thresholds are not sent to the MN, then T310/T312 timer values can be {\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf0\cb1 provided as assistance information.{\fs22\par}}\pard\plain\tx1190{\plain\tab\fs20\f2\cf